      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيَّاطٌ</span></b>  <i>A seamster; one whose occupation is that
of sewing;</i> (Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَائِطٌ</span></b>  (K) and
